-- 2. Story text that is different on live: 7872 Vanquish the Invaders! (7790 River Ends is left out: Forever reused that id
--    and ours is still the REUSE placeholder, so it needs the whole quest built).
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.\n\nEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!\n\nDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $n, and I shall reward you.' WHERE `ID`=7872;

